{"id": "61296", "title": "吟言语色(淫言欲色)", "author": "悠然泛", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 8, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/61/61296.htm", "intro": "属性分类：现代／其他／一般言情／轻松\r\n\r\n关键字：陆言 　N男N女 　18禁 \r\n\r\n文案：\r\n\r\n一个少女有玉女到欲女的华丽蜕变史。\r\n\r\n本文高辣、NP、十八禁、群P。\r\n\r\n本文天雷滚滚，不适者自带纸巾。\r\n\r\nPS：乖小孩最好不要看哦，真的；和我一样有感情洁癖的，千万不要看哦，受不了，真的。", "base": "files/article/html/61/61296", "chapters": [{"title": "1-10", "file": "9027211.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "9027214.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "9027217.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "9027218.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "9027219.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-54", "file": "9027225.html", "available": false}, {"title": "55-65", "file": "9027226.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-68+番外", "file": "9027228.html", "available": false}]}